    IF `the parties are an employer and the employer's employees or a trade union representing them`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "An employer and the employer’s employees or a trade union representing the employer’s employees may negotiate"
    ELSE NOTHING

