    IF `the person or trade union requests or invites negotiations for the payment by an employer of an annual wage supplement` AND (`the annual wage supplement requested` GREATER THAN `one month's wages of the employees`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Any person who, or any trade union of employees which, requests (whether orally or in writing) or invites negotiations for the payment by an employer of an annual wage supplement which is in excess of the amount specified in subsection (3)"
    ELSE NOTHING

